      "created_at": "2019-05-02T00:46:33.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Is it a</p>\n<p>\"When a Device is dealt damage, if it is the first time <strong><em>that</em></strong> <em>Device</em> has been dealt damage this turn, this card deals...\"</p>\n<p>or is it a</p>\n<p>\"When a Device is dealt damage, if it is the first time <strong><em>any</em></strong> <em>Device</em> has been dealt damage this turn, this card deals...\"</p>\n<p>?</p>\n<p>I'm guessing the latter, because otherwise some villains can really incinerate themselves.</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:52:45.558Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
