      "read": false,
      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "[quote=\"Glamour\"]\nThe first time a Nemesis card would be dealt damage by a Hero target each turn, redirect that damage to the Hero target with the highest HP.\n[/quote]\n\n&nbsp;\n\n[quote=\"Backlash Generator\"]\nThe first time any Device is dealt damage by a non-Hero target each turn, this card deals the source of that damage 1 Lightning Damage.\n[/quote]\n\n&nbsp;\n\nSo, I guess the difference is \"any\" instead of \"a\".\n",
